{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T14:06:26.121Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-covpax","lineage:pm-covpax","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-covpax","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-covpax","lineage:pm-covpax","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T14:06:26.121Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence: the change is CLI presentation only. SDK runTest results and test-all summaries are unchanged. projectLinkedTestEvidence already hoisted the shared context and, under --lean, dropped successful streams. It now also projects a quiet success when lean is set, ok is true, every row passed, the shared context has mismatch_detected false and every failure category is zero. In that case execution_context becomes {pm_context_mode, workspace_context_mode, trust_reason, restore_with: 'rerun without --lean'} and failure_categories is omitted. Any failure, skip, non-zero category, mismatch or heterogeneous context keeps the full 21-field context and the categories. The default and non-lean JSON shapes are unchanged, so existing parsers are unaffected. Measured on the 58-test fleet item, --only-last passing run on this branch: lean TOON 2178 to 865 bytes (-60%), lean JSON 2645 to 1166 bytes (-56%). Default TOON stays 2212 and default JSON 2695. A deliberately failing lean run keeps all 21 context fields with sandbox paths and assertion_failure: 1. A first draft compacted the context on an ok run with a non-zero category; the unit test caught it and the condition now requires all-zero categories. output.spec 41/41, the linked-test trust integration test, test-command and test-all suites, ESLint and the static quality gate (LOC cap; execution.ts shrank) pass."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T14:06:26.121Z"}],"before_hash":"9bd3d80231e9440e4b3f5c923d332cdf4a205d6bee66388be829dd368602e1df","after_hash":"9750326dec10645979c8a8cc427724921e0d2aec90905d1f1421b2ffa35cd377","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b38d1e4a25659ab68f5eb3866706d162678ab53aca081cf61d71c59e33c85bb1"}
